      "data": {
        "text": "Jin alfaaz ke aakhir mein gol 'ta' [ة / ـة] hoti hai, woh muannath (feminine) hote hain. Gaur karein ke iss sabaq aur pichle sabaq mein kaun kaun se alfaaz muannath hain?",
